{{also|Waschen}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|wascan|lang=goh}}, {{term|waskan|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*waskaną}}, ultimately from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*wod-||water; wet}}. Compare Low German {{term|waschen|lang=nds}}, Dutch {{term|wassen|lang=nl}}, English {{term|wash|lang=en}}, West Frisian {{term|waskje|lang=fy}}, Danish {{term|vaske|lang=da}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈvaʃn̩]|[ˈvaʃən]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-waschen.ogg|audio|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-strong|class=6|wäscht|wusch|gewaschen|past subjunctive=wüsche}}

# to [[wash]]
#: '''''Wasch''' dir die Hände, bevor du [[zu Tisch gehen|zu Tisch gehst]].''

